<title>POLAND: BETON STAL TO START 10 MLN CPS' PROGRAMME.</title>
<headline>BETON STAL TO START 10 MLN CPS' PROGRAMME.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Beton Stal SA wants to issue commercial papers with outstanding debt of up to 10 million zlotys, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the three-year programme would be carried out by the Bank Handlowy SA brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
